    "Tunable parameters for Coverage / Completeness include chunk size, chunk overlap, top-k, embedding model choice, and chunking hyperparameters.",
    "If recall is low, increase chunk size to retrieve more information.",
    "Failure: Relevancy.",
    "Relevancy is about how relevant the retrieved results are to the query.",
